{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupMappings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","text":"GroupMapping"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/setdirectoryconfig\/groupmappings"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","title":"groupMappings","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK18SetDirectoryConfigV13groupMappingsSayAA12GroupMappingVGSgvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupMappings","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupMapping","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"At most 500; every ","type":"text"},{"code":"group_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" a group of the tenant. Default empty.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig\/groupMappings"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SetDirectoryConfig":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/setdirectoryconfig","role":"symbol","title":"SetDirectoryConfig","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SetDirectoryConfig"}],"abstract":[{"code":"PUT \/api\/v1\/tenants\/{tenant_id}\/directory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"replacement","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Every ","type":"text"},{"code":"DirectoryConfig","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"member except ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"tenant_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the two timestamps, plus the write-only ","type":"text"},{"code":"bind_secret","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"An omitted optional member is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reset to its default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", not kept.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SetDirectoryConfig"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SetDirectoryConfig/groupMappings":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupMappings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","text":"GroupMapping"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig\/groupMappings","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/setdirectoryconfig\/groupmappings","title":"groupMappings","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"At most 500; every "},{"code":"group_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" a group of the tenant. Default empty."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The table is the only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"who names a group ","type":"text"},{"code":"admins","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"axiam_directory::dn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so ","type":"text"},{"code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"cn=staff,ou=groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are the same row.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","title":"GroupMapping","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"identifier"}]}}}